                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG ZUR ADAPTIVEN KODIERUNG UND DEKODIERUNG EINES QUANTISIERUNGSPARAMETERS AUF BASIS EINER QUADTREE-STRUKTUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL PERMETTANT DE CODER ET DE DÉCODER DE MANIÈRE ADAPTATIVE UN PARAMÈTRE DE QUANTIFICATION BASÉ SUR UNE STRUCTURE QUATERNAIRE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS FOR ADAPTIVELY ENCODING AND DECODING A QUANTIZATION PARAMETER BASED ON A QUADTREE STRUCTURE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to an apparatus for encoding a video, wherein slices of the video are split into a quadtree of largest coding units (LCUs) which are further split into a plurality of coding units (CUs) until a minimum CU size, the apparatus comprising: a quantization differential value storage block unit determination module to determine for which CUs to store a quantization parameter differential value; a quantization module to perform quantization using a determined quantization parameter (QP) value for a current CU; a quantization parameter (QP) value prediction block determination module to determine a quantization parameter (QP) prediction value for the current CU; a quantization parameter (QP) differential value generation module to generate a single quantization parameter differential value; and a QP storage module to record the generated QP differential value and information on the determination of the quantization differential value storage block unit. Other aspects include an apparatus for decoding a video and a computer-readable recording medium.</p>
            </abstract>
